msgstr "Der Düsenreiniger kann während dieses Drucks überlaufen."

#: src/feature/indx_nozzle_cleaner_calibration/screen_nozzle_cleaner_calibration.cpp:39
msgid ""
"The nozzle diameter was measured wider than expected.\n"
"\n"
"Clean the nozzle, then press Retry."
